DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/access/idp_federation_grants/{grant_id}
Deletes an IdP federation grant. The identity provider remains in the account, but it is no longer available for federation to other accounts.
Required: account_id (path); grant_id (path) — UID of the IdP federation grant.

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/access/idp_federation_grants/{grant_id}
Retrieves a single IdP federation grant by its UID.
Required: account_id (path); grant_id (path) — UID of the IdP federation grant.
